\":\"mittee did a lot of preparatory work so as\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.013105067523372371,\"x\":0.11530397634481984},{\"y\":0.6482084691672425,\"text\":\"to make it a success.\",\"width\":0.1970649783833343,\"height\":0.013128739770150055,\"x\":0.1111111191416661},{\"y\":0.6351744190422586,\"text\":\"The programme was about the same\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.013081394655308332,\"x\":0.15932915419752128},{\"y\":0.6205211727782494,\"text\":\"as that of last year.\",\"width\":0.18448636762846898,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"x\":0.11530398907185906},{\"y\":0.6205211723783632,\"text\":\"The only difference\",\"width\":0.1761006223404059,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.31656184522392705},{\"y\":0.609011627920907,\"text\":\"was that we started lessons at the second\",\"width\":0.37316561507819845,\"height\":0.011627906774465013,\"x\":0.11740041724077503},{\"y\":0.5924341286811254,\"text\":\"period, since a special mass was celebrat-\",\"width\":0.3777289260476687,\"height\":0.01690155302662788,\"x\":0.11507746899083493},{\"y\":0.5813953487445506,\"text\":\"ed in honour of\",\"width\":0.1698113169629733,\"height\":0.011764260456693987,\"x\":0.1153039825737196},{\"y\":0.5796880841224175,\"text\":\"St. Ignatius\",\"width\":0.1091395725311251,\"height\":0.01358894820322043,\"x\":0.3018243450770061},{\"y\":0.5683139537817102,\"text\":\"Lower\",\"width\":0.05660377351719596,\"height\":0.010187674966619542,\"x\":0.11740041866593033},{\"y\":0.5662792877116885,\"text\":\"substituted\",\"width\":0.0946621325143866,\"height\":0.014243750929444188,\"x\":0.3457506955373121},{\"y\":0.5537459283866916,\"text\":\"teachers in Forms I, II and Ill so that they\",\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.01311453654634065,\"x\":0.11530398018378275},{\"y\":0.5406976746650931,\"text\":\"could take\",\"width\":0.10691823447973013,\"height\":0.011745321789471186,\"x\":0.11740042214692735},{\"y\":0.5390879478491669,\"text\":\"a rest on that day.\",\"width\":0.1991614182939646,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"x\":0.2222222291828569},{\"y\":0.5247093021876728,\"text\":\"same time, it provided a chance for the\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.11530397634481984},{\"y\":0.5100977199308776,\"text\":\"students to gain some teaching experience.\",\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.11530399290053585},{\"y\":0.298395715300962,\"text\":\"“Simple，\",\"width\":0.06571644651138434,\"height\":0.010700891227597986,\"x\":0.23657732109594617},{\"y\":0.3008720931575328,\"text\":\"isn't it？\\\"\",\"width\":0.07127882059407703,\"height\":0.008720929770205665,\"x\":0.30188679396571483},{\"y\":0.2586344870210088,\"text\":\"During the\",\"width\":0.11534926808340193,\"height\":0.014707770953349297,\"x\":0.16140293601450176},{\"y\":0.26017441902409,\"text\":\"second recess, refresh-\",\"width\":0.21593290887009053,\"height\":0.013115483386508808,\"x\":0.2788260019940252},{\"y\":0.24853420224371325,\"text\":\"ments were served for the teachers and the\",\"width\":0.3773584948994591,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.11740042089408594},{\"y\":0.23094462512277958,\"text\":\"prefectS.\",\"width\":0.07127882777130615,\"height\":0.013355048859934882,\"x\":0.11949685419610795},{\"y\":0.23255813995432273,\"text\":\"Furthermore, the teachershad a\",\"width\":0.2851152823763082,\"height\":0.013081394655308332,\"x\":0.20964362142540266},{\"y\":0.21791530952316884,\"text\":\"free treat during unch time.\",\"width\":0.25157232993297274,\"height\":0.013189341268632693,\"x\":0.11740042203560992},{\"y\":0.20488599373226246,\"text\":\"In the afternoon, various games were\",\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.013137261952950063,\"x\":0.16142558675342641},{\"y\":0.19040697681218832,\"text\":\"arranged to be played between the teach-\",\"width\":0.37945490610117305,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.11740043587324278},{\"y\":0.17877906991703096,\"text\":\"ers and the students.\",\"width\":0.19496855282716222,\"height\":0.011774676319830646,\"x\":0.11949685891136633},{\"y\":0.17719869714679104,\"text\":\"But owing to bad\",\"width\":0.16352201158554064,\"height\":0.014661767816698923,\"x\":0.33123689798081457},{\"y\":0.16279069740327357,\"text\":\"weather, only badminton was played. The\",\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.11949685122675972},{\"y\":0.1511400653922046,\"text\":\"teachers won all the matches.\",\"width\":0.27044023171081255,\"height\":0.011726384364820763,\"x\":0.11740043259847202},{\"y\":0.13648208448489774,\"text\":\"After the tournament, a small Variety\",\"width\":0.3312368742834254,\"height\":0.014680706483921724,\"x\":0.16352202854661696},{\"y\":0.12500000020976254,\"text\":\"Show\",\"width\":0.04402515558510149,\"height\":0.010179152783819423,\"x\":0.11949685660996497},{\"y\":0.12500000037652514,\"text\":\"WaS\",\"width\":0.035639410297038515,\"height\":0.00887622118772824,\"x\":0.18029350264323477},{\"y\":0.1250000002388324,\"text\":\"held\",\"width\":0.05031446455114874,\"height\":0.010179152783819423,\"x\":0.2159329153135241},{\"y\":0.12500000000424027,\"text\":\"in the School Hall. It\",\"width\":0.22641507971432567,\"height\":0.011627906774464902,\"x\":0.27044025511139075},{\"y\":0.10901162795075403,\"text\":\"consisted of singing by the School Choir\",\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.11949685789618228},{\"y\":0.09446254040895308,\"text\":\"and the Talent Time winners, verse-speak-\",\"width\":0.3836477859224336,\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.11740043209119393},{\"y\":0.06677524408337832,\"text\":\"26\",\"width\":0.025157232275574357,\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.11740041971126942},{\"y\":0.5436046513212927,\"text\":\"Badminton Match\",\"width\":0.13207547034391898,\"height\":0.008838345406497972,\"x\":0.6603773575167198},{\"y\":0.5029069770667256,\"text\":\"ing and a short play by the Chinese Dra-\",\"width\